  "title": "woww: Change SMSG_AUTH_RESPONSE result field size from 4 to 1",
  "description": "I somehow mistook the size of this field for a u32 instead of a u8 earlier.\n\nvmangos clearly shows that it's a u8:\nhttps://github.com/vmangos/core/blob/cd896d43712ceafecdbd8f005846d7f676e55b4f/src/game/World.cpp#L322\n\nand cmangos:\nhttps://github.com/cmangos/mangos-classic/blob/98a53ea30db095ea88442449e3515fd20c9314c5/src/game/Server/WorldSession.cpp#L947\n\nAdditionally, the size of the `packet-woww.c` file means that my IDE just gives up on syntax highlighting because of the size. Is it possible to move the giant list of opcodes and defines into a different file to compartmentalize things a little?",
