      "title": "woww: Change SMSG_AUTH_RESPONSE result field size from 4 to 1",
      "message": "woww: Change SMSG_AUTH_RESPONSE result field size from 4 to 1\n\nI somehow mistook the size of this field for a u32 instead of a u8\nearlier.\n\nvmangos clearly shows that it's a u8:\nhttps://github.com/vmangos/core/blob/cd896d43712ceafecdbd8f005846d7f676e55b4f/src/game/World.cpp#L322\n\nand cmangos:\nhttps://github.com/cmangos/mangos-classic/blob/98a53ea30db095ea88442449e3515fd20c9314c5/src/game/Server/WorldSession.cpp#L947\n",
      "author_name": "Gtker",
